            <h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>
            <p class="large close"><strong>Is a written consent required from the teachers?</strong></p>
            <p>No, we are not collecting any personal information from teachers who participate in the study.</p>
            
            <p class="large close"><strong>Is written consent required from the students?</strong></p>
            <p>No, students are not directly participating in the study. There are no surveys for the students. The study is about training the teachers.</p>

            <p class="large close"><strong>Are teachers and students given kits?</strong></p>
            <p>Yes. Participating teachers and their students are given an oral-hygiene kit. Teachers are also given educational booklets, and teaching materials.</p>

            <p class="large close"><strong>How are participants paid?</strong></p>
            <p>Compensation is provided through a ClinCard (reloadable gift card).</p>

            <p class="large close"><strong>Total compensation?</strong></p>
            <p>Up to $300 for completing all training sessions and follow-up surveys</p>

